{"id":"torrey:altars","source":"torrey","name":"Altars","slug":"altars","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Designed for sacrifice — Ex 20:24.","refs":[["Exod",20,24,20,24]]},{"text":"To be made of earth, or unhewn stone — Ex 20:24,25; De 27:5,6.","refs":[["Exod",20,24,20,24],["Exod",20,25,20,25],["Deut",27,5,27,5],["Deut",27,6,27,6]]},{"text":"Of brick, hateful to God — Isa 65:3.","refs":[["Isa",65,3,65,3]]},{"text":"Natural rocks sometimes used as — Jdj 6:19-21; 13:19,20.","refs":[["Judg",6,19,6,21],["Judg",13,19,13,19],["Judg",13,20,13,20]]},{"text":"Were not to have steps up to them — Ex 20:26.","refs":[["Exod",20,26,20,26]]},{"text":"For idolatrous worship, often erected on roofs of houses — 2Ki 23:12; Jer 19:13; 32:29.","refs":[["2Kgs",23,12,23,12],["Jer",19,13,19,13],["Jer",32,29,32,29]]},{"text":"Idolaters planted groves near — Jdj 6:30; 1Ki 16:32,33; 2Ki 21:3.","refs":[["Judg",6,30,6,30],["1Kgs",16,32,16,32],["1Kgs",16,33,16,33],["2Kgs",21,3,21,3]]},{"text":"The Jews not to plant groves near — De 16:21.","refs":[["Deut",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"For idolatrous worship, to be destroyed — Ex 34:13; De 7:5.","refs":[["Exod",34,13,34,13],["Deut",7,5,7,5]]},{"text":"Probable origin of inscriptions on — De 27:8.","refs":[["Deut",27,8,27,8]]},{"text":"Of Noah. — Ge 8:20.","refs":[["Gen",8,20,8,20]]},{"text":"Of Abraham. — Ge 12:7,8; 13:18; 22:9.","refs":[["Gen",12,7,12,7],["Gen",12,8,12,8],["Gen",13,18,13,18],["Gen",22,9,22,9]]},{"text":"Of Isaac. — Ge 26:25.","refs":[["Gen",26,25,26,25]]},{"text":"Of Jacob. — Ge 33:20; 35:1,3,7.","refs":[["Gen",33,20,33,20],["Gen",35,1,35,1],["Gen",35,3,35,3],["Gen",35,7,35,7]]},{"text":"Of Moses. — Ex 17:15; 24:4.","refs":[["Exod",17,15,17,15],["Exod",24,4,24,4]]},{"text":"Of Balaam. — Nu 23:1,14,29.","refs":[["Num",23,1,23,1],["Num",23,14,23,14],["Num",23,29,23,29]]},{"text":"Of Joshua. — Jos 8:30,31.","refs":[["Josh",8,30,8,30],["Josh",8,31,8,31]]},{"text":"Of the temple of Solomon. — 2Ch 4:1,19.","refs":[["2Chr",4,1,4,1],["2Chr",4